# 60. Fundamental Invariants required

## Document Contract Invariant required

prose required minLength=68

expect:
  State the Document Contract Invariant: an MDS schema defines what a valid Markdown document must contain.

validate:
  semantic: optional

## Semantic Invariant required

prose required minLength=98

expect:
  State the Semantic Invariant: a valid document has a stable semantic structure independent of superficial Markdown formatting.

validate:
  semantic: optional

## Conformance Invariant required

embed text

expect:
  State the Conformance Invariant: conforming implementations must derive equivalent semantic document models
  from the same document/schema pair, and show the same-input-yields-same-output diagram plus the definition of
  diagnostic identity as the pair of code and semantic path.

validate:
  semantic: optional

## Generation Invariant required

prose required minLength=91

expect:
  State the Generation Invariant: the same MDS schema used to specify generated output can be used to validate that output.

validate:
  semantic: optional

## Semantic Expectation Invariant required

prose required minLength=261

expect:
  State the Semantic Expectation Invariant: an MDS contract may state expected content in any schema-defined region through expect, readable by humans and LLMs, but it does not alter deterministic Core validity unless an explicit semantic-validation extension is used.

validate:
  semantic: optional

## Introspection Invariant required

prose required minLength=62

expect:
  State the Introspection Invariant: every schema-defined document region is machine-inspectable.

validate:
  semantic: optional

## Recursive Validation Invariant required

prose required minLength=91

expect:
  State the Recursive Validation Invariant: embedded content may delegate validation to another format or schema system, recursively.

validate:
  semantic: optional

## Core Invariant required

prose required minLength=41

expect:
  State the Core Invariant: MDS Core implements MDS semantics only.

validate:
  semantic: optional

## Extension Invariant required

prose required minLength=49

expect:
  State the Extension Invariant: external formats and validators remain modular.

validate:
  semantic: optional

## Superset Invariant required

prose required minLength=106

expect:
  State the Superset Invariant: MDS must not be restricted to the feature intersection of JSON Schema, XSD or other schema technologies.

validate:
  semantic: optional

## Interoperability Invariant required

prose required minLength=56

expect:
  State the Interoperability Invariant: conversions must expose semantic loss explicitly.

validate:
  semantic: optional

